# Prettier scope is the hand-written frontend under ui/. Everything listed here
# is generated or vendored: formatting it would either be overwritten on the
# next build or add churn we do not own.

# Vendored browser libraries (preact, htm, codemirror, microlighter).
ui/vendor/

# Generated by `make bindings` from internal/gui via wails3.
ui/bindings/

# Compiled Tailwind output. Regenerate with `npm run css`.
ui/output.css

# Dependencies.
node_modules/

# Docs site build output.
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/

# NOTE on embeddedLanguageFormatting: the root package.json sets it to "off",
# which is why the `html` tagged templates in ui/app.js and ui/components are
# left alone. Prettier's HTML formatter does not understand htm — it splits tags
# across lines (`title=${x}\n  >${y}</span\n>`) and reflows text inside elements,
# which changes the text actually inserted into the DOM. Keeping it off preserves
# the templates verbatim while still formatting the JavaScript around them.
